This repository contains the AGPL-3.0-or-later iOS client for Ramflux. It
depends on the BSD-3-Clause Ramflux core workspace maintained in the
ramfluxhq/ramflux repository.

This product bundles the following fonts (in Packages/RFDesign/Resources/Fonts/),
each licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. The full license
text sits beside each font file as <font file>.OFL.txt:

- Hanken Grotesk (variable font), Copyright 2021 The Hanken Grotesk Project
  Authors (https://github.com/marcologous/hanken-grotesk). The upstream
  license declares no Reserved Font Name.
  License: HankenGrotesk.ttf.OFL.txt
- JetBrains Mono (variable font), Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project
  Authors (https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono). The upstream license
  declares no Reserved Font Name.
  License: JetBrainsMono.ttf.OFL.txt
- Noto Sans SC (variable font, reduced glyph subset), Copyright 2014-2021
  Adobe (http://www.adobe.com/), with Reserved Font Name 'Source'.
  License: NotoSansSC.ttf.OFL.txt

The Noto Sans SC file is not the upstream file: it is a subset that keeps the
weight axis and the glyphs needed by the app's Simplified Chinese text. Its
family name is Noto Sans SC, and no Reserved Font Name ('Source') is used in
its names. Details are recorded in Packages/RFDesign/Resources/Fonts/PROVENANCE.json.
